    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107749" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπέροπτος</span></b>  (A), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
